## Commands
- `pre-commit run --all-files`: format, lint and check everything
{%- if 'python' in languages %}
- `uv sync`: create/update `.venv` from `uv.lock`
- `uv run pytest`: run tests
- `uv run pyright`: type-check (same engine as VS Code Pylance)
- `uv add <pkg>` / `uv add --dev <pkg>`: add a dependency; never edit `uv.lock` by hand
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'c' in languages %}
- `cmake --workflow --preset dev`: configure, build and test (Debug, into `build/dev`)
- `cmake --workflow --preset asan`: same with Address/UB sanitizers
- `cmake --workflow --preset lint`: build with clang-tidy (needs `clang-tidy` installed)
- `cmake --workflow --preset ci`: what CI runs (warnings are errors)
- New source files must be added to the target in `CMakeLists.txt`
{%- endif %}

